# Assemble the Players: "Once each turn, you may cast a creature spell with power 2 or less from the top of your library." (CR 601.3).
# Bot1 casts it on turn 1 with two Mox Pearls, then Memnite (power 1) from the top: the next card, Ornithopter, is refused, a second cast this
# turn. On turn 3 the top card is Goblin Roughrider (power 3), refused with the mana for it; on turn 5 it is Lightning Bolt, no creature, refused
# with the mana for it; on turn 7 it is Goblin Piker (power 2), cast. Bot2, with no Assemble the Players of its own, cannot cast its own top Memnite.
# "You may look at the top card of your library any time." (CR 401.2): Bot1 does not see its top card before the enchantment is out, and sees it after,
# while Bot2 never does.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Assemble the Players
Island
Island
Island
Memnite
Ornithopter
Goblin Roughrider
Lightning Bolt
Goblin Piker
Island x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x8
Memnite
Island x21

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
? Bot1.Sees.Bot1.LibraryTop = (hidden)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Assemble the Players.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Library.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = 1
! Bot1.Library.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
! Bot2.Library.Memnite.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Sees.Bot1.LibraryTop = Goblin Roughrider
? Bot2.Sees.Bot1.LibraryTop = (hidden)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
! Bot1.Library.Goblin Roughrider.Cast
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#1.Activate
! Bot1.Library.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#1.Activate
Bot1.Library.Goblin Piker.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

