Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Pearl; Mox Pearl; Mox Ruby; Assemble the Players; Memnite; Goblin Piker
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Ornithopter; Goblin Roughrider; Lightning Bolt
